          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">Liberty Media, Sirius XM Holdings, New Sirius and their respective subsidiaries&#8217; indebtedness could adversely affect operations and could limit the ability of such subsidiaries to react to changes in the economy or their industry; </font>
        </div>
