              <div style="white-space:nowrap;">
                <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">CY2023E Adjusted EBITDA</font><font style=" position:relative; bottom:4.25pt;font-size:6.5pt;letter-spacing:0.15pt;">(1)</font>
