        <div style="text-indent:20pt; margin-top:8pt; width:456pt; line-height:11.5pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">The ranges of multiples used by Solomon Partners were chosen by Solomon Partners utilizing its professional judgment and experience, taking into account Solomon Partners&#8217; review of the multiples of the Selected Companies. </font>
        </div>
