          <!--blacklining:none;-->
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">incur or assume any indebtedness for borrowed money or guarantee any indebtedness for borrowed money or issue or sell any debt securities or options, warrants, calls or other rights to acquire any debt securities of Liberty Media, New Sirius or any of their respective subsidiaries, other than, among other things, (a)&#160;the assumption by New Sirius of Liberty Media&#8217;s 2.75% Exchangeable Senior Debentures due 2049 and Liberty Media&#8217;s 3.75% Convertible Senior Notes due 2028, (b)&#160;the incurrence of indebtedness by New Sirius in connection with the promissory note to be entered into with Sirius XM Radio and (c)&#160;the incurrence of certain permitted indebtedness (including under the Margin Loan), subject to certain conditions specified in the Merger Agreement; </font>
        </div>
