          <!--blacklining:none;-->
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">amend the organizational documents of New Sirius or any of its subsidiaries or the organizational documents of Liberty Media (solely with respect to the Liberty SiriusXM Group) other than certain amendments related to the Split-Off; </font>
        </div>
        <div style="clear:both; padding:0pt; margin:0pt;font-size:0pt;line-height:0pt;">&#8203;</div>
        <div style=" float:left; margin-left:20pt; line-height:12pt; margin-top:6.1pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-align:left; width:10pt;white-space:nowrap;">
