          <!--blacklining:none;-->
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">adopt a plan or agreement of complete or partial liquidation, dissolution, restructuring, recapitalization, merger, consolidation or other reorganization (other than as expressly contemplated by the Restructuring); </font>
