          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">settle or compromise (or amend any settlement or compromise related to) any action related to the New Sirius business, New Sirius or its subsidiaries other than in accordance with the Reorganization Agreement or with respect to the Agreed Settlement to the extent such amendments would not have an adverse impact on Sirius XM Holdings or the holders of Sirius XM Common Stock other than Liberty Media and its affiliates; </font>
