          <!--blacklining:none;-->
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">use, encumber, or transfer or attribute out of the Liberty SiriusXM Group any assets that will be New Sirius Assets other than cash prior to the Measurement Date and as permitted by certain other provisions of the Merger Agreement; </font>
        </div>
