          <!--blacklining:none;-->
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">pay, discharge or satisfy liabilities, other than, among other things, (a)&#160;in the ordinary course of business consistent with past practice, (b)&#160;tax liabilities due and payable under applicable law and (c)&#160;any indebtedness of Liberty Media (with respect to the New Sirius business, New Sirius and New Sirius&#8217; subsidiaries) and New Sirius or their subsidiaries (with respect to the New Sirius business); </font>
        </div>
