          <!--blacklining:none;-->
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">make any changes in the capital structure of New Sirius or any of its subsidiaries, other than, among other things, (a)&#160;the assumption by New Sirius of Liberty Media&#8217;s 2.75% Exchangeable Senior Debentures due 2049 and Liberty Media&#8217;s 3.75% Convertible Senior Notes due 2028, (b)&#160;the incurrence of indebtedness by New Sirius in connection with the promissory note to be entered into with Sirius XM Radio and (c)&#160;the incurrence of certain permitted indebtedness (including under the Margin Loan), subject to certain conditions specified in the Merger Agreement; </font>
        </div>
