          <!--blacklining:none;-->
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">take any action, or fail to take any action, that will result in Liberty Media being in breach of its obligations under the Sirius/Liberty Tax Sharing Agreement in any material respect; </font>
        </div>
        <div style="clear:both; padding:0pt; margin:0pt;font-size:0pt;line-height:0pt;">&#8203;</div>
