        <div style=" line-height:12pt; text-align:left; margin-left:30pt;">
          <!--blacklining:none;-->
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">make any investment (by contribution to capital, property transfers, purchase of securities or otherwise) in, any person (other than a subsidiary of Sirius XM Holdings) if such investment would reasonably be expected to impede or delay, in any material respect, the ability of the parties to satisfy any of the conditions to the Merger set forth in the Merger Agreement; </font>
