          <!--blacklining:none;-->
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">no law, order or other legal restraint will be in effect enjoining, restraining, preventing or prohibiting the consummation of any of the Transactions or making the consummation of any of the Transactions illegal; </font>
        </div>
