        <div style=" margin-top:5.2pt; margin-bottom:0pt; line-height:12pt; text-align:left; margin-left:20pt;">
          <!--blacklining:none;-->
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">ARPU for Sirius XM excludes subscriber revenue from our connected vehicle services of $161, $182 and $190 for the&#160;years ended December&#160;31, 2023, 2022 and 2021, respectively. </font>
        </div>
