        <div style=" margin-top:4pt; margin-bottom:0pt; line-height:12pt; text-align:left; margin-left:20pt;">
          <!--blacklining:none;-->
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">Based on (a)&#160;a Schedule&#160;13G, filed jointly on February&#160;13, 2024, by Corvex Management LP (</font><font style="font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:-0.2pt;">Corvex</font><font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">) and Keith Meister, with respect to LLYVA and (b)&#160;a Form 13F, filed on May&#160;15, 2024, by Corvex with respect to LSXMA, LSXMK and LLYVK, which state that Corvex has sole voting power and sole dispositive power/investment discretion over 369,460 shares of LSXMA, 192,258 shares of LSXMK, 1,558,332 shares of LLYVA and 925,378 shares of LLYVK. </font>
        </div>
        <div style="clear:both; padding:0pt; margin:0pt;font-size:0pt;line-height:0pt;">&#8203;</div>
        <div style=" float:left; line-height:12pt; margin-top:4pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-align:left; width:20pt;white-space:nowrap;">
