        </div>
        <div style=" margin-top:4pt; margin-bottom:0pt; line-height:12pt; text-align:left; margin-left:20pt;">
          <!--blacklining:none;-->
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">Based on a Form 13F, filed on May&#160;15, 2024, by Point72 Asset Management, L.P. (</font><font style="font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:-0.2pt;">Point72 Asset Management</font><font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">) which states that Point72 Asset Management has shared voting power and shared investment discretion over 1,344,499 shares of LLYVA and 962,687 shares of LLYVK. </font>
        </div>
