        </div>
        <div style=" margin-top:4pt; margin-bottom:0pt; line-height:12pt; text-align:left; margin-left:20pt;">
          <!--blacklining:none;-->
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">Includes 379,553 LSXMB shares, 1,689,230 LSXMK shares, 100,137 LLYVB shares, 306,655 LLYVK, 122,649 FWONB shares and 68,798 FWONK shares held by three trusts with respect to which Mr.&#160;Malone is the sole trustee and, with his wife, retains a unitrust interest in the trusts. </font>
