          <!--blacklining:none;-->
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">Liberty Media expects, based on a Form 13F, filed May&#160;10, 2024, by Vanguard, which Form 13F reports sole voting power, shared voting power, sole investment discretion and shared investment discretion for shares of LSXMA and LSXMK, that the sole voting power, shared voting power, sole investment discretion and shared investment discretion of Vanguard for shares of New Sirius Common Stock will be as follows: </font>
        </div>
        <div style="clear:both; padding:0pt; margin:0pt;font-size:0pt;line-height:0pt;">&#8203;</div>
