              </div>
              <div style="margin-top:6pt;">
                <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">All such board determinations will be made in accordance with the certificate of incorporation and applicable Delaware law.</font>
              </div>
              <div style="margin-top:6pt;">
                <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">As of June&#160;30, 2024, (a)&#160;the Formula One Group did not have an intergroup interest in either the Liberty SiriusXM Group or the Liberty Live Group, (b)&#160;the Liberty SiriusXM Group did not have an intergroup interest in either the Formula One Group or the Liberty Live Group and (c)&#160;the Liberty Live Group did not have an intergroup interest in either the Liberty SiriusXM Group or the Formula One Group.</font>
