            <td style="padding:0pt; width:0pt;">&#8203;</td>
            <td style="padding:4.333pt 0pt 0.5pt 0pt; width:158pt;white-space:normal;">
              <div>
                <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">Upon Liberty&#160;Media&#8217;s liquidation, dissolution or winding up, holders of shares of Liberty SiriusXM Common Stock will be entitled to receive in respect of such stock their proportionate interests in Liberty Media&#8217;s assets, if any, remaining for distribution to holders of common stock (regardless of the group to which such assets are then attributed) in proportion to their respective number of liquidation&#160;units per share. </font><font style="font-style:italic;letter-spacing:0.2pt;">See Article&#160;IV, Section&#160;A.2.(h) of Liberty Media&#8217;s certificate of incorporation.</font>
              </div>
              <div style="margin-top:6pt;">
                <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">Each share of Liberty SiriusXM Common Stock will be entitled to a number of liquidation&#160;units as set forth in the statement on file with the </font>
