      <div style="margin-top:6pt;margin-bottom:96pt;margin-left:69.66pt;width:456pt;">
        <div style=" float:left; margin-left:20pt; line-height:12pt; text-align:left; width:20pt;white-space:nowrap;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">(d)</font>
          <br >
        </div>
        <div style=" line-height:12pt; text-align:left; margin-left:40pt;">
          <!--blacklining:none;-->
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">Liberty Media&#8217;s Current Reports on Form 8-K filed on <a style="-sec-extract:exhibit" href="http://www.sec.gov/ix?doc=/Archives/edgar/data/1560385/000110465924041336/tm2410155d1_8k.htm">April 1, 2024</a> and <a style="-sec-extract:exhibit" href="http://www.sec.gov/ix?doc=/Archives/edgar/data/1560385/000110465924071928/tm2417389d1_8k.htm">June 17, 2024</a> (other than any portion thereof not deemed to be filed pursuant to the rules promulgated under the Exchange Act). </font>
        </div>
        <div style="clear:both; padding:0pt; margin:0pt;font-size:0pt;line-height:0pt;">&#8203;</div>
        <div style="text-indent:20pt; margin-top:8pt; width:456pt; line-height:12pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">Sirius XM Holdings incorporates by reference the documents listed below that Sirius XM Holdings has previously filed with the SEC (other than any report or portion thereof furnished or deemed furnished under any Current Report on Form 8-K): </font>
        </div>
        <div style=" float:left; margin-left:20pt; line-height:12pt; margin-top:8pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-align:left; width:20pt;white-space:nowrap;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">(a)</font>
          <br >
        </div>
