        <div style="text-indent:20pt; margin-top:7.9pt; width:456pt; line-height:12pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">The weighted average GDFV per stock option granted during the three&#160;months ended March&#160;31, 2024 was $1.54. The total intrinsic value of stock options exercised during each of the three&#160;months ended March&#160;31, 2024 and 2023 was $1. During the three&#160;months ended March&#160;31, 2024, the number of net settled shares issued as a result of stock option exercises was less than 1. </font>
        </div>
        <div style="text-indent:20pt; margin-top:8pt; width:456pt; line-height:12pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">The Company recognized share-based payment expense associated with Sirius XM Holdings stock options of $8 for each of the three&#160;months ended March&#160;31, 2024 and 2023. </font>
