        </div>
        <div style="clear:both; padding:0pt; margin:0pt;font-size:0pt;line-height:0pt;">&#8203;</div>
        <div style="margin-left:20pt; margin-top:8pt; width:436pt; line-height:12pt;font-size:10pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">Our debt as of December&#160;31, 2023 and December&#160;31, 2022 consisted of the following: </font>
        </div>
      </div>
