        <div style="text-indent:20pt; margin-top:11.02pt; width:456pt; line-height:11.5pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">Our effective tax rate of 18.3% for the year ended December&#160;31, 2023 was primarily impacted by benefits related to research and development and certain other credits, partially offset by federal and state </font>
