        <div style=" margin-top:8pt; margin-bottom:0pt; line-height:12pt; text-align:left; margin-left:20pt;">
          <!--blacklining:none;-->
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">Share-based payment expense is presented as a separate line item for the purpose of this note and consists of $46 related to cost of services, $52 related to sales and marketing, $39 related to engineering, design and development and $72 related to general and administrative. These amounts have been excluded from these line items in this table for the year ended December&#160;31, 2022. </font>
