          <!--blacklining:none;-->
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">On August&#160;3, 2023, the Company reclassified its then-outstanding shares of common stock into three new tracking stocks&#8201;&#8212;&#8201;Liberty SiriusXM common stock, Liberty Formula One common stock and Liberty Live common stock, and, in connection therewith, provided for the attribution of the businesses, assets and liabilities of the Company&#8217;s remaining tracking stock groups among its newly </font>
