      <div style="margin-top:6pt;margin-left:69.66pt;width:456pt;">
        <div style="text-indent:20pt; width:456pt; line-height:11.5pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">IN WITNESS WHEREOF, Liberty Sirius XM Holdings Inc. has caused this Amended and Restated Certificate of Incorporation to be executed by its duly authorized officer on this [&#8226;] day of [&#8226;], 20[&#8226;]. </font>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-left:220pt; margin-top:24pt; width:236pt; line-height:12pt;font-weight:bold;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:-0.2pt;">LIBERTY SIRIUS XM HOLDINGS INC.</font><font style="font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.2pt;"> </font>
        </div>
        <div style=" float:left; margin-left:220pt; line-height:12pt; margin-top:23.1pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-align:left; width:20pt;white-space:nowrap;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">By:</font>
